== step 8: standalone third-party verification ==
The ALLOW'd receipt above can be independently re-verified by ANYONE,
on ANY machine (including a phone with no network path to this
gateway), using nothing but the receipt file and the three public
artifact files, with the standalone agent_trace CLI -- no gateway,
no socket, no daemon involved:

  agent_trace verify $CM_2B_ARTIFACTS/aegis_pruned_model.cis.safetensors $CM_2B_ARTIFACTS/embed.bin $CM_2B_ARTIFACTS/vocab.bin /tmp/safe8-demo-70868/receipt.orig

(run now, on this box, against the exact receipt used above, for
 illustration -- a third party would run the equivalent command
 after copying the receipt and the three artifact files to their
 own machine):
receipt trace-chain 8039848b70d66e50
local   trace-chain 8039848b70d66e50
